      "canonical_url": "https://www.enersys.com/en/about-us/news/enersys-surpasses-4-million-hawker-armasafe-plus-6tagm-batteries-sold-worldwide-marking-two-decades-of-proven-field-performance/",
      "title": "EnerSys Surpasses 4 Million Hawker® ARMASAFE™ Plus 6TAGM Batteries Sold Worldwide, Marking Two Decades of Proven Field Performance",
      "summary": "READING, PENNSYLVANIA — March 23, 2026 — EnerSys (NYSE: ENS), a global leader in stored energy solutions for industrial applications, has surpassed 4 million Hawker® ARMASAFE™ Plus 6TAGM batteries sold worldwide. Engineered with proprietary Absorbed Glass Mat (AGM) Thin Plate Pure Lead (TPPL) technology, the maintenance-free battery delivers higher starting power, long service life, deep cycle capability, and superior reliability across demanding industrial and military applications. EnerSys will celebrate the innovation behind this state-of-the-art battery solution at the 2026 AUSA Global Force Symposium &amp; Exposition in booth #722 starting Tuesday, March 24, 2026.",
      "published_at": null,
      "fetched_at": "2026-07-28T21:37:39.039431+00:00",
